{
  "dom_id": "step-t6298",
  "name": "The Sample Mean as an Unbiased Estimator",
  "problem": "One important feature of $\\overline{X}$ is that it's an **unbiased estimator** of $\\mu.$ This means that the expected value of $\\overline{X}$ equals $\\mu,$ that is\n\n$$\n\\textrm{E}[\\overline{X}] = \\mu.\n$$\n\n \n\nWe can easily show that $\\overline{X}$ is an unbiased estimator of $\\mu$ using the properties of expectation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[\\overset{―}{X}] & =\\text{E}[\\frac{1}{n}{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{X}_{i}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}\\cdot \\text{E}[{\\sum }_{i=1}^{n}{X}_{i}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}\\cdot \\text{E}[{X}_{1}+{X}_{2}+⋯+{X}_{n}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}\\cdot (\\text{E}[{X}_{1}]+\\text{E}[{X}_{2}]+⋯+\\text{E}[{X}_{n}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}\\cdot (\\mu +\\mu +⋯+\\mu ) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{n}\\cdot n\\mu  \\\\  & =\\mu \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe fact that $\\overline{X}$ is an unbiased estimator of $\\mu$ is a desirable property. We'll meet so-called **biased estimators** in future lessons. \n\nFinally, any estimate $\\bar{x}$ of the population mean $\\mu$ found by computing the mean of a sample is called an **unbiased estimate** of $\\mu.$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t6298\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">The Sample Mean as an Unbiased Estimator</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t6298\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n                            -webkit-transition: none;\n                            -moz-transition: none;\n                            -ms-transition: none;\n                            -o-transition: none\n                            }\n\n                            .mjx-svg-href {\n                            fill: blue;\n                            stroke: blue\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox {\n                            display: table!important\n                            }\n\n                            .MathJax_SVG_LineBox span {\n                            display: table-cell!important;\n                            width: 10000em!important;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage__block {\n                            text-align: center;\n                            margin: 1em 0em;\n                            position: relative;\n                            display: block!important;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            width: 100%\n                            }</style><p>One important feature of <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"2.131ex\" height=\"3.009ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -1150.1 917.6 1295.7\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-1-Title\">\\overline{X}</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E1-MJMATHI-58\" d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 3